[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891253\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891911\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891304\">1080D34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891407\">1060F50</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing nuts (1a) and disconnect the wiring (1b) from\nthe heater plugs.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889735\">A40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the heater plugs.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035391.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the heater plugs.</p><p>Connect the electrical wiring to the heater\nplugs.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891407\">1060F50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891304\">1080D34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891911\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891253\">1048A10</a></p><p>Check the operation of the heater plugs.</p>"]]